Listen to Input
Cut Input into Chars
Put 0 into Count
While Chars
Roll Chars into Letter
Build Count up

Put false into Won
If Count is 2
Put true into Won

If Count is 3
Put true into Won

If Count is 5
Put true into Won

If Count is 7
Put true into Won

If Count is 11
Put true into Won

If Count is 13
Put true into Won

If Count is 17
Put true into Won

If Count is 19
Put true into Won

If Count is 23
Put true into Won

If Count is 29
Put true into Won

If Won
Say "You win the game, congratulation !"
Else
Say "Try again..."
